u encounter in the Unknown.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A hardcore auto battle rogue-like deck-building (H.A.R.D) game, &quot;Corrupted&quot; has the strategy of an auto-battler and the challenging difficulty of a rogue-like. Build your own team and skill card deck, and retake the stolen planet through strategic placement and real-time card use!",
